etc. that is used to determine the overall effectiveness of the stat.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#属性#LAST#\n你的角色的主要属性。基础值：你的角色的基础属性，能通过升级加点增加，被等级制约。当前值：基础值加上来自装备、状态、技能等效果后的实际值。这一数值用来决定属性值的实际效果。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ca14ce5182128eb14c7bb428ea03ba7a4ae5118634b176e60baaeac660ad7558","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ec283daadb6d5fe2e9157ed2371bf8de9ceb105cf8ef97d781f7233935126e0e","logical_entry_identity":"21f4e0cf4e44c99e2e4f62bedb3b257ef817fec5900b4b7e7bc5c99fbabf483f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The connection between predator and prey allows you to speak to the mind of your target and beckon them closer. For %d turns, they will try to come to you, even pushing others aside to do so. They will move towards you instead of acting %d%% of the time, but can save verses Mindpower to slow the effect. If they take significant damage, the beckoning may be overcome altogether. The effect makes concentration difficult for your target, reducing Spellpower and Mindpower by %d until they reach you.\n\t\tThe Spellpower and Mindpower reduction increases with your Willpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"猎手与猎物之间的联系让你能直接对目标的心智说话，引诱它靠近。在 %d 回合内，它会试图向你走来，甚至推开挡路者。目标有 %d%% 的时间会朝你移动而不进行其他行动，但可以用精神豁免对抗你的精神强度，以减缓该效果。若受到较大伤害，它可能彻底摆脱引诱。该效果会干扰目标集中精神，使其在抵达你身边前法术强度和精神强度降低 %d 点。\n\t\t法术强度和精神强度的降低值随你的意志提高。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"771612906be63d597f351b54120f2287a397deaada325f2a2ee4b28ef585f094","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ec2980bc702bdc2f67a4cdd572d594ffa93fde30130ed02ad5481bbf5fe1983f","logical_entry_identity":"14c4045f2cd09be1eda8ece6ff25c9be64a1903dbd6999dea83f8f142690af2d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Iceblock: %d","source_tag":"tformat","target":"冰块：%d"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"219ac4ca081d56e53930cc44427999a18efb3601d950dc0b5e07e4f9c71db174","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ec29931af992d8ad613b0dffa5e4e70fbd1b0120fc6c5f917e851ee7d63ca5d2","logical_entry_identity":"2970a19a46d8902ace349b365fa8259e6eeeba1e814e15595d6c17739da468b4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The next Steady Shot or Shoot has 100%% chance to be a critical hit and mark.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"下一次稳固射击或者射击100%%暴击并触发标记。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e2ac28509a833a2ad82a896278445d2886ec3ce270c5b9b7f084e14e605ed165","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ec30ce277d225ca4f0fc3af0880866ed5eba0ec5e98dd9d8a3ab0d14955e676d","logical_entry_identity":"d2726e47d6f2afd86cdf7bdf98ac04db110e6cd1d460a375c8aea84d31b76bc3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Infects the target with parasitic carrion worm larvae for 5 turns.  Each turn the disease will remove a beneficial physical effect and deal %0.2f acid and %0.2f blight damage.\nIf not cleared after five turns it will inflict %0.2f blight damage as the larvae hatch, removing the effect but spawning a full grown carrion worm mass near the target's location.\nEven if this disease is removed early, there is still a %d%% chance for the larvae to hatch.\nYou can never have more than 5 worms active from any source at a time.\nThe damage dealt will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"使目标感染腐肉寄生幼虫持续 5 回合。每回合会移除目标一个物理增益效果并造成 %0.2f 酸系和 %0.2f 枯萎伤害。\n\t\t若 5 回合后仍未清除，幼虫孵化时会造成 %0.2f 枯萎伤害；该效果随之移除，并在目标附近生成一个成熟的腐肉虫群。\n\t\t即使该疾病被提前移除，幼虫仍有 %d%% 几率孵化。\n\t\t无论来源如何，你同时最多只能拥有 5 个腐肉虫群。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b817822de5de01f4a3e075f237be838c37bead053197c1fab0414ae2ca812910","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ec365884af90a4902ea7fa2ea0eba688dfb19d46d9d861698f68d58d75945b79","logical_entry_identity":"16515c163938e86382ba6adacc3f61ea26ce7122b1908c1e25c68d172cc432df","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Enhanced Munitions","source_tag":"talent name","target":"强化弹药"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4c3b7beaa1ca631f9002a45f453161e929f4471efd05a8e4b505257a8c619fc6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ec3cc69cf38712b503bee09e873b